<!--
智庫觀察彙整頁（2026-09-21）：歷期智庫格子攤成一條時間線，首頁
「我想看智庫怎麼分析」卡片的落點。設計語彙沿用 Carnival 藍系統
（topic_issue_list.html.jinja），資料來自 issues.thinktank_json
（pipeline/thinktank_watch.py）。
-->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>智庫觀察｜{{ newsletter_name }}</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Big+Shoulders+Display:wght@700;800&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@700;900&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --color-paper:   oklch(93% 0.020 240);
    --color-paper-2: oklch(89% 0.024 238);
    --color-paper-3: oklch(83% 0.028 235);
    --color-ink:     oklch(16% 0.030 250);
    --color-ink-2:   oklch(28% 0.028 248);
    --color-muted:   oklch(46% 0.020 245);
    --color-accent:      oklch(58% 0.160 247);
    --color-accent-ink:  oklch(97% 0.010 240);
    --color-accent-2:    oklch(76% 0.150  75);
    --color-focus:   oklch(58% 0.160 247);
    --font-display: "Big Shoulders Display", "Noto Sans TC", sans-serif;
    --font-body:    "IBM Plex Sans", ui-sans-serif, "PingFang TC", "Noto Sans TC", sans-serif;
    --font-label:   "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;
    --page-gutter: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    --shell: 46rem;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { overflow-x: clip; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body { background: var(--color-paper); color: var(--color-ink); font-family: var(--font-body); }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--color-focus); outline-offset: 2px; }
  h1 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.01em; line-height: 0.96; text-transform: uppercase; }

  .halftone { height: 14px; background-image: radial-gradient(var(--color-ink) 1.5px, transparent 1.5px); background-size: 10px 10px; opacity: 0.5; }
  .masthead { background: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-accent-ink); padding: 2.4rem var(--page-gutter) 2rem; }
  .masthead-inner { max-width: var(--shell); margin: 0 auto; }
  .back-link { font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 0.78rem; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.85; }
  .back-link:hover { opacity: 1; text-decoration: underline; }
  .masthead .eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin: 0 0 0.6rem; }
  .masthead h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.6vw + 1rem, 3rem); }
  .masthead p { margin: 1rem 0 0; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; color: color-mix(in oklch, var(--color-accent-ink) 82%, transparent); max-width: 56ch; }
  .ornament-row { text-align: center; color: var(--color-accent-2); letter-spacing: 0.6em; padding: 1.5rem 0; font-size: 0.9rem; }

  .timeline { max-width: var(--shell); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--page-gutter) 4rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
  .tt-card { background: var(--color-paper-2); border: 2px solid var(--color-ink); box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--color-ink); padding: 1rem 1.2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .tt-meta { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.8em; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .tt-date { font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--color-muted); }
  .tt-source { font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-accent); }
  .tt-issue { font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--color-muted); }
  .tt-issue:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  a.tt-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  a.tt-title:hover { color: var(--color-accent); text-decoration: underline; }
  .tt-comment { margin: 0; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-ink-2); }
  .tt-insight { margin: 0; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-ink-2); border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent); padding-left: 0.7em; }
  .tt-insight b { color: var(--color-accent); font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }

  .empty { max-width: var(--shell); margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem var(--page-gutter); color: var(--color-muted); line-height: 1.7; }
  .foot { background: var(--color-ink); color: var(--color-accent-ink); padding: 1.5rem var(--page-gutter) 2.5rem; }
  .foot-inner { max-width: var(--shell); margin: 0 auto; font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.7; opacity: 0.85; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="halftone" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<header class="masthead">
  <div class="masthead-inner">
    <a class="back-link" href="/">← 回首頁</a>
    <p class="eyebrow">DELTA AI TREND DAILY</p>
    <h1>智庫觀察</h1>
    <p>台灣智庫的政策與供應鏈研究，每格轉述智庫的論點，再附一段對台達的推測性啟示。標題連到智庫原文。</p>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="ornament-row" aria-hidden="true">✱ ✱ ✱ ✱</div>

{% if entries %}
<section class="timeline" aria-label="智庫觀察時間線">
  {% for e in entries %}
  <article class="tt-card">
    <div class="tt-meta">
      <span class="tt-date">{{ e.issue_date }}</span>
      <span class="tt-source">{{ e.source_name }}</span>
      <a class="tt-issue" href="/issues/{{ e.issue_id }}">出自第 {{ e.issue_id }} 期</a>
    </div>
    <a class="tt-title" href="{{ e.article_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ e.article_title }}</a>
    {% if e.comment %}<p class="tt-comment">{{ e.comment }}</p>{% endif %}
    {% if e.delta_insight %}<p class="tt-insight"><b>對台達</b>　{{ e.delta_insight }}</p>{% endif %}
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
{% else %}
<div class="empty">
  <p>還沒有智庫觀察的內容。智庫來源（DSET、中華經濟研究院）已在抓取清單裡，下一期日報出刊時這裡就會開始累積。</p>
</div>
{% endif %}

<footer class="foot">
  <div class="foot-inner"><p>{{ newsletter_name }}．僅供台達內部參考。啟示為 AI 推測性延伸，請以智庫原文為準。</p></div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
